# Cursor & AI Assistant Operating Rules

You are working on the Interactive 3D Virtual Science Laboratory Platform.
The mission of this repository is a complete, uncompromising clean-room reverse engineering of PraxiLabs (and Labster-class) virtual science simulations.

Before writing or editing any code, you MUST review:
1. AGENTS.md
2. PRAXILABS_REVERSE_ENGINEERING_SPECIFICATION.md

Key mandates:
- No cosmetic shortcuts or fake triggers.
- Enforce full university-grade scientific protocols (PPE, pipetting, rinsing, 3 concordant trials, data calculations).
- Variable-flow physics, Web Audio API sound synthesis, spatial constraint sockets.
- Free camera orbit/pan/zoom without rubber-banding locks.
- 100% TypeScript type safety and clean `npm run build` verification.

